Package: netOP
Title: Network Analysis and Model Selection Tools
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Sayan", "Chakrabarty", , "sayanc@umich.edu",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-2372-2076"))
Description: Tools for generating, estimating, embedding, clustering, and
    selecting statistical network models. The package includes spectral and
    latent-space utilities together with SONNET, NETCROP, edge
    cross-validation (ECV), and node cross-validation (NCV) workflows for
    scalable network analysis and model selection.
License: GPL (>= 2)
